  "updated_at": "2026-03-22",
  "bio": "Libby Wells is renowned for her exceptional realism tattoo style that brings art to life on the skin. Operating out of Shoreham-by-Sea, close to Brighton in the United Kingdom, she melds her proficiency as an oil painter with her tattoo artistry, providing clients with stunningly detailed and authentic pieces. Her professional demeanor is evident not only in her artwork but also in the cleanliness and orderliness of Ephemeral Studio 13, which she owns and operates, ensuring a top-tier experience for all her clients.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Brighton, England, United Kingdom"
}